flowchart TD
  validate{Check the inputs}:::check
  validate -->|refused| invalid(Refused: an input is missing, malformed or not used):::transform
  validate -->|ok| attach[Attach the mirror and the change log]:::query
  attach --> decide{Read the table and decide}:::check
  decide -->|refused| refused(Refused: not a poison hold, a stale epoch or LSN, or the confirmation differs):::transform
  decide -->|already| already(Already quarantined):::transform
  decide -->|would| preview[Dry run: record the preview]:::load
  decide -->|act| act[Spend the preview, record the quarantine and return the table to live, in one transaction]:::load
  act --> outcome{Result}:::check
  outcome -->|done| done(Quarantined: resync the table next):::transform
  outcome -->|already| already
  outcome -->|busy| busy(An apply run holds the table; retry):::transform
  outcome -->|refused| moved(Refused: no matching preview, or the table changed):::transform
  whois[Look up who started this run]:::query
  audit[Copy the result to the operations database]:::load
  audit --> snapshot[Refresh the operations snapshot, once]:::load
